 r←GetMainOrMaster folder;branches;bool
⍝ Returns either "main" or "master" (deprecated but still valid), whichever the project has.\\
⍝ Signals an error in case the project has neither of them.
 branches←2↓¨ListBranches folder
 bool←'main' 'master'∊branches
 ('Neither a "main" nor a "master" branch found in ',folder)U.Assert∨/bool
 r←(bool⍳1)⊃'main' 'master'
⍝Done
